ympic medals, but nobody won three. Only two skiers won two golds, " [:a {:href "/athletes/100112"} "Giorgio Di Centa"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/101644"} "Björn Lind"] ", Lind in the two sprint races."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/2135"} "Sprint (Freestyle), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "22 February 2006"] "\n" [:td {} "80"] "\n" [:td {} "34"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/2130"} "15 kilometres (Classical), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "17 February 2006"] "\n" [:td {} "99"] "\n" [:td {} "46"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/2134"} "50 kilometres (Mass Start, Freestyle), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "26 February 2006"] "\n" [:td {} "79"] "\n" [:td {} "31"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/2131"} "30 kilometres Skiathlon, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "12 February 2006"] "\n" [:td {} "76"] "\n" [:td {} "27"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/2148"} "4 × 10 kilometres Relay, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "19 February 2006"] "\n" [:td {} "64"] "\n" [:td {} "16"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/2152"} "Team Sprint (Classical), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "14 February 2006"] "\n" [:td {} "48"] "\n" [:td {} "24"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/2162"} "Sprint (Freestyle), Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "22 February 2006"] "\n" [:td {} "66"] "\n" [:td {} "28"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/2157"} "10 kilometres (Classical), Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "16 February 2006"] "\n" [:td {} "72"] "\n" [:td {} "29"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {